me can factorial n
    if n is small or same 1
        give 1
    give n * (me factorial (n - 1))

me can fib n
    if n is small 2
        give n
    give (me fib (n - 1)) + (me fib (n - 2))

me can gcd a b
    if b is 0
        give a
    give me gcd b (a % b)

say me factorial 10
say me fib 15
say me gcd 48 18
